  "5742bba0-238c-49b5-9030-3a7685ce8ee1"],
 " in Eqs. (30--32), Tables 1 - 2 of Roussel et al. (2015) are represented by \
R2015g\[Lambda], R2015g\[Phi], R2015gr, R2015T\[Lambda]\[Lambda], R2015T\
\[Lambda]\[Phi], R2015T\[Lambda]r, R2015T\[Phi]\[Lambda],R2015T\[Phi]\[Phi], \
R2015T\[Phi]r, R2015Tr\[Lambda], R2015Tr\[Phi], and R2015Trr.\n3. The symbols \
in Roussel et al. (2015) are represented as follows: \n\t\[FilledSquare] (",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox["X", "P"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "feecdac0-3432-49a7-aaf6-18f8303d6df0"],
 ", ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox["Y", "P"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "7ff5b1cd-cb63-4c08-b0c6-d15699d27d04"],
 ", ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox["Z", "P"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "658fb2e4-b82a-4765-a2ea-79c4eb93d148"],
 ") \[RightArrow] (x, y, z)\n\t\[FilledSquare] (",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox["X", "S"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "859ad53a-bf5d-4859-ba32-16a57ce7a424"],
 ", ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox["Y", "S"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "6e14a3f5-a03a-4a17-99fa-ee9af9203e0b"],
 ", ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox["Z", "S"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "f46cf6b9-1809-4bab-bf04-652f5036d8bd"],
 ") \[RightArrow] (x\[CloseCurlyQuote], y\[CloseCurlyQuote], z\
\[CloseCurlyQuote]), which are represented by (x3, y3, z3)\n\t\[FilledSquare] \
(",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox["\[CapitalDelta]X", "PS"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "37fa07fd-9fc1-44b2-aa0f-982a357f7f7f"],
 ", ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox["\[CapitalDelta]Y", "PS"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "325652a0-6c6b-40c3-ae54-c756b1752d1f"],
